      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Down Nodes & Hardware Tickets\n\nCurrent Slurm-unavailable nodes across **SU1\u2013SU7**, refreshed every **5 minutes**. `Reason` and `HW ticket` come directly from Slurm. **OS reporting** is the node-exporter path; **BMC ping** is an ICMP check from the head node because the ObsVM has no BMC route. Missing telemetry remains **unknown**, never healthy.\n\nThe collector performs one `sinfo` and one bounded BMC sweep per refresh. It probes only nodes already unavailable, with at most eight concurrent one-second pings.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Current rows matching the selected unavailable Slurm states.",
